  displayImage: {fileID: 0}
  displayText: ' A sports shop is selling all shoes at 80% price.<br>If Cole wants
    shoes that were priced at 72.50 and assume an added sale cost (after new price)
    at 6.5%<br>What is the total cost of the shoes?'
  solutionImage: {fileID: 0}
  solutionText: 61.77 = 72.5 x (0.8) x (106.5/100)
